DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
contract MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t
        WHO    NOT (t EQUALS Tenant OF "Carol")
        MUST   Sign (EXACTLY t)
        WITHIN 14
        UPON   EACH WITHIN 30
        HENCE  FULFILLED
        LEST   BREACH BY t

tenants MEANS LIST (Tenant OF "Alice"), (Tenant OF "Bob")

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`with a roll` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t IN tenants
        WHO    NOT (t EQUALS Tenant OF "Carol")
        MUST   Sign (EXACTLY t)
        WITHIN 14
        UPON   EACH WITHIN 30
        HENCE  FULFILLED
        LEST   BREACH BY t
